issue,definition,decision_rule
UN reform & representation,"Institutional reform, UN80, Security Council reform/representation, veto or leadership-selection issues.",Source priority reference and/or evidence-linked reviewed topic.
Ukraine / Russia,"Russia-Ukraine war, Russia-related European security, Black Sea or directly linked regional security.",Source Ukraine/Russia priority reference and/or evidence-linked reviewed topic.
Middle East,"Israel/Palestine/Gaza, Iran/Gulf/Hormuz, Golan and directly linked regional issues.",Source Israel/Palestine or Iran/Hormuz priority reference and/or evidence-linked reviewed topic.
Development & finance,"Development financing, debt/financial architecture, SDGs, jobs, industrialization, investment, taxation, technology transfer.",Evidence-linked reviewed topic or >=5 full-text matches to the defined lexicon.
Climate & environment,"Climate mitigation/adaptation/finance, biodiversity, oceans, drought/flood, water security and environmental policy.",Evidence-linked reviewed topic or >=4 full-text matches to the defined lexicon.
AI & digital,"AI governance/capacity, digital policy, cyber issues and emerging-technology governance.",Source Artificial Intelligence priority reference and/or evidence-linked reviewed topic.
"Human rights, health & social","Human rights, health, gender, children/youth, education and related social policy.",Evidence-linked reviewed topic or >=8 full-text matches to the defined lexicon.
"Humanitarian, migration & refugees","Humanitarian assistance/access, migration, displacement, refugees and asylum/return issues.","Source Humanitarian Aid/Migration reference, evidence-linked reviewed topic, or >=3 full-text matches."
Other peace & security,"Substantive peace/security issues other than the separately coded Ukraine/Russia and Middle East categories, including peacekeeping, terrorism, crime, DRC/Haiti/Sudan/Afghanistan and disarmament.",Evidence-linked reviewed topic or >=3 full-text matches to defined specific-security lexicon.
Sovereignty & territorial disputes,"Self-determination, territorial disputes/claims, decolonization, Kosovo, Cyprus, Essequibo and analogous disputes.",Evidence-linked reviewed topic or >=2 full-text matches to the defined specific-dispute lexicon.
